  "title": "UK: TotalEnergies Completes the Merger of its UK North Sea Upstream Assets with NEO NEXT",
  "summary": "Paris, March 30, 2026 – TotalEnergies announces the completion of the merger between NEO NEXT and TotalEnergies’ UK Upstream Oil & Gas business. The combined group is renamed NEO NEXT+ and TotalEnergies holds a 47.5% shareholding interest in it. Further to this transaction, NEO NEXT+ becomes the largest independent Oil and Gas producer on the […]",
